Hi Altuna,
I figured out that annotateWithGeneParts is also a part of genomation.
I changed my code line to:

diffCpGann_hypo=annotateWithGeneParts(as(myDiff25p_hypo,"GRanges"),gene.obj)

and the error disappeared.

I found the code to annotate here:
https://compgenomr.github.io/book/annotation-of-dmrsdmcs-and-segments.html

Thank you.

